1
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,120
(Royal Betrothal)

2
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,120
(This is a work of fiction)

3
00:01:28,121 --> 00:01:29,976
(Adapted from Qidian's "Long Live Your Majesty" by Xing Yan Yan)

4
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,840
(Episode 5)

5
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,440
Chief.

6
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,720
Chief!

7
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,120
They're all over there.

8
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:56,120
Chief, they're all quality goods shipped from various provinces.

9
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,280
Go.

10
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,240
These are their indentures.

11
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,839
There will be no future troubles.

12
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,480
- Send them all over. - Yes.

13
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,920
Chief, those are just toys.

14
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,280
They're not worth much.

15
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,440
Open it.

16
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,200
Get up.

17
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,560
How old are you two?

18
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,920
- Six. - I'm five.

19
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,280
Tell me,

20
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,760
why did you come here?

21
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,999
He said there would be good food...

22
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,696
- if we followed them. - if we followed them.

23
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:10,720
Who said that?

24
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,960
Can you point him out to me?

25
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,480
- It's him. - It's him.

26
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,520
I... Chief.

27
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,159
It wasn't me. I didn't know anything.

28
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,520
I didn't know there were children.

29
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,200
I'll take you to a nice place.

30
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,720
There are a lot of good food there.

31
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,240
How about that?

32
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,240
- All right. - All right.

33
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,040
You're good kids.

34
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,920
Come.

35
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,440
Careful.

36
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,736
Chief, I really didn't know there were children inside.

37
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:46,840
I didn't know anything.

38
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,160
He was the one in charge of this. It was him.

39
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:50,440
It was him!

40
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,896
- It wasn't me. - Chief, spare me!

41
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:54,201
Even if I had all the guts in the world, I wouldn't dare!

42
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:57,240
Chief, this really has nothing to do with me.

43
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,519
Chief, it really wasn't my fault.

44
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,160
I truly didn't know anything, Chief!

45
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,960
Chief, please spare me. Chief.

46
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,360
Chief...

47
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:05,800
Didn't I tell you?

48
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,520
You can sell anything, but not children.

49
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,960
You did say that.

50
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,440
Chief.

51
00:04:11,441 --> 00:04:12,719
This really had nothing to do with me.

52
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,440
Chief, please spare my life.

53
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,120
There won't be a next time.

54
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,080
Brother, that was close.

55
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,600
How many times have I told you?

56
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,440
The Chief detests this the most!

57
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,639
He repeatedly said not to touch children!

58
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:50,200
I was wrong. I had a moment of madness.

59
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,920
The price for children is high lately.

60
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,240
I'll never do it again.

61
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,160
Do you think the Chief doesn't know who really did it?

62
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,000
My dear brother,

63
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,800
you also heard him just now.

64
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,560
The Chief said...

65
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,480
this is the last time.

66
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,440
I understand.

67
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,840
My brother, I can make amends for my mistake.

68
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:14,120
Regarding the destruction of the Shazhou Branch,

69
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:15,440
I've found out who did it.

70
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:18,160
- Really? - Absolutely.

71
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:25,159
(Imperial Study)

72
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,360
After extensive investigation,

73
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,479
the pattern on this arrow...

74
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,719
is very similar to a flower...

75
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,720
called xiyan.

76
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,720
This flower grows in the miasma forest...

77
00:05:30,721 --> 00:05:32,640
on the border of Beijian and former Zhongwan.

78
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,040
It is nourished by the miasma.

79
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,936
It blooms at night, withers by day, and feeds on living things.

80
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,760
It also symbolizes hatred and revenge.

81
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,919
With this flower as their mark,

82
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,640
the buyer is certainly not a friend.

83
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,720
Could it be Beijian?

84
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:46,040
Although Beijian lacks iron ore,

85
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,376
and their weapons are outdated,

86
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,600
their warhorses are excellent.

87
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,816
And they've been expanding their cavalry in recent years.

88
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:51,920
We must be on our guard.

89
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,536
It's even less likely to be Zhongwan.

90
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,000
Zhongwan has long submitted to us.

91
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,600
We have lived in peace for many years.

92
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,120
When Zhongwan fell back then,

93
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,719
its people were exiled everywhere,

94
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,976
becoming slaves for generations.

95
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,576
However, within the Zhongwan imperial family,

96
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,160
a remnant force escaped.

97
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,840
Their whereabouts remain unknown.

98
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,000
This matter must be thoroughly investigated.

99
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:09,280
Your Majesty,

100
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,880
this is like looking for a needle in a haystack.

101
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,599
Moreover, as this involves classified information,

102
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,776
I can only investigate privately,

103
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,160
making it even more difficult.

104
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,840
In that case,

105
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,720
how about I grant you a position...

106
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,840
that'll allow you to investigate discreetly...

107
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,800
while inspecting the capital's merchants...

108
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,216
and the commercial taxes of each province...

109
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,280
called Imperial Envoy for Cultural Collection?

110
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,680
Imperial Envoy for Cultural Collection?

111
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:34,439
Why... Why does this title sound a bit indecent?

112
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:38,240
Why? Does that not suit your refined reputation?

113
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,336
Your Majesty's words are pearls of wisdom. Of course it suits me.

114
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,519
I'll take Your Majesty...

115
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:43,976
to Changle Street first to collect cultural materials.

116
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,839
Imperial Envoy for Cultural Collection, in this palace,

117
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:47,456
the Left Chancellor's spies are everywhere.

118
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,840
The shadow guards just reported...

119
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,839
that the Left Chancellor's spreading rumors among the people...

120
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,896
that this Special Imperial Examination is just a front.

121
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,080
Once the results are out,

122
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,440
the talented women will be sent to the Royal Academy.

123
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,840
After enduring for three months,

124
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,399
the Left Chancellor still can't swallow his anger...

125
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:00,600
regarding the Ministry of War.

126
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:04,400
Now, he simply wants to embarrass me in the Special Imperial Examination.

127
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,120
He spread these rumors...

128
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,816
just because he believes that women are timid and afraid of trouble,

129
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,040
unable to weather any storm.

130
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:13,136
Indeed, some examinees have already withdrawn and returned home.

131
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,320
Your Majesty, will you just let these rumors run wild?

132
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,800
An official...

133
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,240
must possess courage and wisdom.

134
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,240
If they give up on the exam...

135
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:23,160
and go home today simply because of rumors,

136
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,799
how will they withstand the overt...

137
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,800
and covert attacks in the Imperial Court later on?

138
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,960
I should actually thank the Left Chancellor...

139
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:32,400
for saving me the trouble in the Palace Examination.

140
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,440
Your Majesty.

141
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,920
Your Majesty.

142
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:42,640
By order of the Left Chancellor,

143
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,320
I present this plaque.

144
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,120
"Great Ning's Ancestral Teachings."

145
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:52,519
"Romance between monarch and subject shakes the nation's foundation."

146
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,760
"It should be punished by nine familial exterminations?"

147
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:57,119
I recall Emperor Taizong's affair with a female official...

148
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,120
triggered a mutiny in two provinces.

149
00:07:58,121 --> 00:07:59,881
That is why we have this ancestral teaching.

150
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,999
The Left Chancellor is hinting that Your Majesty's giving women...

151
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,200
a Special Imperial Examination for the sake of romance?

152
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,400
The Left Chancellor ordered me...

153
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,600
to hang this in the center of the study.

154
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,200
If Your Majesty does not permit it,

155
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,000
the Left Chancellor will come in person.

156
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,400
How bold of you!

157
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,679
Huo An, how dare you speak so insolently?

158
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,680
Huang Bo.

159
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:23,080
General Huo, you can hang it up.

160
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

161
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,519
(Great Ning's Ancestral Teachings)

162
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:32,800
First, he spread rumors to scare off female scholars.

163
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:34,576
Now, he brings out the ancestral teachings.

164
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,440
The Left Chancellor made two moves in a row.

165
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,720
It seems like he can't wait any longer.

166
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,360
That old man is so petty.

167
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,440
Your Majesty sent him a Ding Chong plaque,

168
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:45,720
so he gave an ancestral teaching plaque in return.

169
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:47,280
Since I have no such intentions,

170
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,239
even if the hall is covered in ancestral teachings,

171
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,240
what is there to fear?

172
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:52,160
I want to make it clear to all the officials...

173
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:55,600
that women can also be the sharpest blades of the nation.

174
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,560
This Imperial Court...

175
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,400
has never been the Left Chancellor's one-man-show.

176
00:09:01,160 --> 00:09:02,160
I support you, Your Majesty.

177
00:09:02,161 --> 00:09:03,679
Currently, the Special Imperial Examination's female examinees...

178
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,879
are all staying on Changle Street.

179
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:07,320
Why don't Your Majesty go and see these talents for yourself?

180
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,559
You might even run...

181
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:11,536
into the Provincial Examination's Top Scholar from Shazhou.

182
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,719
The Left Chancellor sent this plaque...

183
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,880
to warn you.

184
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,559
Be more discreet.

185
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,560
Me?

186
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,680
Exactly.

187
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:18,999
His Majesty isn't going anywhere.

188
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Why not?

189
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,720
I'm going.

190
00:09:22,721 --> 00:09:27,160
(Great Ning's Ancestral Teachings)

191
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,880
"A thousand lamps in the night market illuminate the blue clouds."

192
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:34,360
"Tall buildings are filled with many elegant guests."

193
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,296
I didn't expect such a grand and bustling scene...

194
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:39,040
outside the palace.

195
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:42,520
Great Ning's prosperous era is just as you wish, Your Majesty.

196
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:45,680
The beauties on Changle Street indeed each have their own charm.

197
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,920
The lady on the left is radiant,

198
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:51,080
while the one on the right has ruby lips and pearly teeth.

199
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:53,520
Wonderful.

200
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,560
The night scene on Changle Street...

201
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,960
is even more dazzling than during the day.

202
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:04,040
This glamorous Changle Street...

203
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,999
is full of handsome men.

204
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,240
I love it so much!

205
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:08,880
Yan Fu Zhi.

206
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,239
Meng Meng, I'm getting hungry.

207
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,359
The waiter told me today...

208
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,439
that Chunman House also has mutton noodles.

209
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:19,440
Let's try it to see how it differs from Shazhou's.

210
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,600
Let's go.

211
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,440
A place of such opulence and romance...

212
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:27,320
is actually where an unsightly side is most likely to breed.

213
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,560
Young Master He,

214
00:10:28,561 --> 00:10:29,719
this isn't Shazhou.

215
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,400
This is the capital.

216
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:33,200
Who would dare to cause trouble here?

217
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:35,280
I only hope this grand scenery...

218
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:38,359
isn't just a gaudy facade hiding a rotten interior.

219
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,479
Young Master He,

220
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,800
you truly never stop worrying about the nation and people.

221
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,280
Cousin, we've been walking for so long.

222
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,880
My stomach is already protesting.

223
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:48,399
Let's go to Changle Street's most famous restaurant, Chunman House,

224
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,400
and get something to eat.

225
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:53,136
The Provincial Examination's Top Scholar is back.

226
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,640
Ma'am, two bowls of mutton noodles.

227
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,840
- I'm starving. - All right.

228
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,280
Perfect, there's a nice table right here. Sit down.

229
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,520
Young Master He, you're here.

230
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,760
Come. Still the usual today?

231
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:09,280
- The usual. Prepare them. - All right.

232
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,680
All right. It's my treat next time.

233
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,720
Sirs.

234
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,440
- Here. - Meng Meng,

235
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,440
what are you looking at?

236
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,280
Nothing.

237
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,600
Apricot blossoms.

238
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:33,760
Meng Meng.

239
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,320
In Shazhou,

240
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:38,160
there are only poplars and sand.

241
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,520
Where would we ever see such beautiful flowers?

242
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:59,360
(Menu Items)

243
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:02,160
Serve all your signature dishes.

244
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,880
And give us a jar of Shaosanbai.

245
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:05,040
- All right. - Wait.

246
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,880
You know Young Master doesn't drink.

247
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,880
You're just craving wine.

248
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:11,119
When it comes to drinking, don't you always drink the most?

249
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,640
Young Master Shen, you usually live from hand to mouth.

250
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:15,280
Why so generous today?

251
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:19,519
Cousin, I performed a great service during my trip to Shazhou.

252
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:22,040
Treating a hero to a meal isn't too much to ask, is it?

253
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,959
I knew taking Young Master out to collect cultural materials...

254
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,960
isn't that simple.

255
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,600
Three bowls of mutton noodles, please.

256
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:28,880
All right.

257
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:30,399
Three bowls of mutton noodles!

258
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:31,400
Cousin.

259
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,719
Just three bowls of mutton noodles?

260
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,840
What's the matter? There's meat, noodles,

261
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,480
and vegetables.

262
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,896
What else do you need, Young Master Shen?

263
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:41,240
Don't tell me you're trying to use Young Master's treat...

264
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,080
to win over those girls.

265
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,840
There are no girls here.

266
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,239
It's just that whenever I eat mutton noodles,

267
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:50,320
I'm reminded of that fierce proprietress in Shazhou.

268
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,800
She was truly formidable.

269
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,040
Enjoy your meal.

270
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,520
This broth is so bland.

271
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,240
The mutton is also soft and mushy, lacking firm texture.

272
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:14,839
Meng Meng, once you become the Top Scholar in the capital,

273
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:16,520
I'll open a Bofeng House to accompany you.

274
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,159
By then, the sign for Chunman House...

275
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:19,840
should be torn down and used for firewood!

276
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:27,880
Fu Zhi.

277
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:30,000
The capital is full of talent.

278
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:32,616
I don't even know if I'll pass the Metropolitan Exam.

279
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:34,016
How can I talk about being the Top Scholar?

280
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:35,040
Meng Meng.

281
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:37,919
I heard today that the women taking the exam...

282
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,280
will be sent to the Royal Academy.

283
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:41,200
Many people gave up on the exam because of it.

284
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,360
I'm a bit worried about you.

285
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,720
Why pay attention...

286
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:47,000
to such a ridiculous rumor?

287
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:49,040
How do you know it's fake?

288
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,416
This Special Imperial Examination...

289
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,919
was only reinstituted because His Majesty...

290
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,816
pressed ahead in the face of obstruction from all sides.

291
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:54,880
This rumor...

292
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,399
must be the work of high-ranking officials...

293
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:57,759
who oppose women taking the Imperial Examination,

294
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:58,760
and they're plotting in the shadows.

295
00:13:58,761 --> 00:14:01,760
They want to use rumors to scare away the timid candidates.

296
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,200
These shameless scoundrels!

297
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,680
They are simply lawless!

298
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Eat your noodles.

299
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,240
Ever since you came back from Shazhou,

300
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:17,160
you've been talking about mutton noodles.

301
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:28,120
The first thing you do with mutton noodles is drink the soup.

302
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:39,240
It's not as good as the ones in Shazhou.

303
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,679
(Imperial Examination Hall)

304
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:04,520
- Meng Meng, I'm here! - Fu Zhi.

305
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,920
Give it to me. I'll carry it.

306
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:10,919
How was it? Was the Metropolitan Examination difficult?

307
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:11,920
Not really.

308
00:15:11,921 --> 00:15:13,280
- Did you do well? - Yes.

309
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:15,960
I knew a mere Metropolitan Examination won't be hard for you.

310
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,200
Fellow student, you dropped your ink stick.

311
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,320
Thank you, miss.

312
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:31,400
Meng Meng, she's so beautiful.

313
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,616
The Metropolitan Examination Hall is full of hidden talents.

314
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:36,240
She must be no ordinary lady.

315
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,600
Let's go.

316
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:42,119
This is the top-tier fortune lot I got for you at Lingquan Temple.

317
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:44,640
The master who interpreted it said you'll surely pass the exam.

318
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,040
(Imperial Examination Hall)

319
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:12,280
Meng Meng, what exactly are you looking for?

320
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:14,720
It's nothing.

321
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:16,280
Maybe I was mistaken.

322
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,000
Are you just too tired?

323
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,439
I especially reserved a very nutritious meal...

324
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,599
for you at Chunman House...

325
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,600
to help nourish you.

326
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,000
Let's go!

327
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,480
This way.

328
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:32,160
He's so handsome.

329
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:41,120
My dear sister, did you miss me in the past three days?

330
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:43,800
I haven't seen you for a few days,

331
00:16:43,801 --> 00:16:45,321
and you've lost quite a bit of weight.

332
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:46,880
Why did you come all of a sudden?

333
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,320
Did you get into trouble again and need me as your shield?

334
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:50,960
How could you say that?

335
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,279
As your dear brother,

336
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,639
of course I'm worried about you.

337
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:55,400
That's why I set aside my work to come here.

338
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:58,559
But you could've entered officialdom through heredity privilege like me.

339
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:01,080
Why did you insist on taking this Special Imperial Examination?

340
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:03,840
You're being so attentive all of a sudden.

341
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:05,720
Fine.

342
00:17:05,721 --> 00:17:07,040
Father asked me to pick you up.

343
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:08,359
Nian was clamoring to come,

344
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:09,800
but he was suddenly held up by work.

345
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,000
I knew it.

346
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,439
Why would Young Master Shen...

347
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,120
suddenly be so concerned about my affairs?

348
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,759
Father wanted me to bring you home to celebrate at once.

349
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:19,360
He even brought out his precious wine.

350
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,119
But it's strange.

351
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:23,040
How did Father know that you'll definitely pass?

352
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,439
Do you not believe in me?

353
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,440
Of course I do.

354
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,199
At three, my sister could recite "The Analects of Confucius".

355
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,399
At seven, you knew the "The Songs of the South".

356
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,759
Everyone in the capital knows...

357
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:31,280
about the talented Ms. Shen.

358
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,360
Besides,

359
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:34,200
look whose sister you are.

360
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,839
Slowly. Don't trip.

361
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,480
(Xu Residence)

362
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:48,920
Left Chancellor.

363
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,656
The Metropolitan Examination is over.

364
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:52,240
The examinees have all left the hall.

365
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:55,560
These are the sealed exam papers.

366
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,000
All right.

367
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,959
The results will be released tomorrow.

368
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:14,256
I'll light a Kongming lantern today for you to welcome good fortune.

369
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:16,000
I hope to enter officialdom through my pen,

370
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:17,520
change my fate,

371
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:23,280
and protect those closest to me.

372
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,320
You definitely will.

373
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:26,039
When you pass the exam, I'll open...

374
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:27,279
a bigger Bofeng House in the capital.

375
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:28,680
We'll stay in the capital together.

376
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,040
Stay in the capital together.

377
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:31,040
Stay in the capital.

378
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,800
May Meng Meng's name be on the list.

379
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:37,520
May Bofeng House open all over Great Ning.

380
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:46,440
(May the wind help me soar to the sky)

381
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:58,160
- That one. - So beautiful.

382
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:01,599
(Examination Result)

383
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:03,119
- Come and see. - Come here.

384
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:05,760
- Look carefully. - I see it.

385
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:07,080
I passed!

386
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,760
- I passed! - Me too!

387
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:11,639
Excuse me, let us through.

388
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:13,399
Let us through. Excuse me.

389
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,840
- Let us through. - I passed!

390
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:18,616
(First place: An Ru Lan Second place: Shen Zhi Li)

391
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:19,720
- I passed too! - I passed!

392
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,640
I passed!

393
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,360
Why aren't you on the list?

394
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:26,040
Let's look for it again...

395
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:27,600
That's me! That one!

396
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,680
Here! I'm here!

397
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,680
Why isn't your name here?

398
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,600
Could there be a mistake?

399
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:23,040
Meng Meng.

400
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:24,600
Let me through.

401
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:26,120
Meng Meng.

402
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:27,320
Meng Meng.

403
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:28,880
Meng Meng!

404
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:31,960
Could there be a mistake?

405
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,639
The Metropolitan Exam is reviewed by the Ministry of Rites...

406
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:40,360
and Hanlin Academy together.

407
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:42,840
There won't be a mistake.

408
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,200
Then I'll go check again.

409
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:45,320
Fu Zhi.

410
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:47,360
Don't check anymore.

411
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:51,960
I'm suddenly a bit hungry.

412
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,440
Let's eat.

413
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:16,120
Are the officials in the capital so arrogant?

414
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:18,280
Your essay didn't even make the cut.

415
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:20,680
I think they're blind.

416
00:21:22,600 --> 00:21:24,160
The capital is full of prying eyes.

417
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:27,280
Don't say things in anger.

418
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:31,960
Great Ning's seven provinces are full of talent.

419
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:33,576
The Provincial Examination Top Scholar...

420
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:35,800
doesn't guarantee passing the Metropolitan Examination.

421
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:38,079
I don't think the capital is all that great anyway.

422
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:40,200
They don't even have a decent bowl of mutton noodles.

423
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:43,400
Shazhou is different now.

424
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:44,736
You're a Provincial Examination Top Scholar.

425
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:45,760
Even if you go back to Shazhou,

426
00:21:45,761 --> 00:21:47,200
you can still get an official post.

427
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,840
Let's go back to Shazhou together.

428
00:21:49,320 --> 00:21:51,040
Vacancies at the government office there...

429
00:21:51,120 --> 00:21:53,040
don't open up every year.

430
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:56,000
Being a Provincial Examination Top Scholar is nothing.

431
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:58,200
I won't let you talk about yourself like that.

432
00:21:58,240 --> 00:22:00,216
Master Zhuge didn't start his career until he was 27.

433
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:02,639
And Jiang Ziya wasn't given a high post until he was 72.

434
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:03,640
After three years,

435
00:22:03,641 --> 00:22:05,376
I'll come back to the capital with you to take the exam again.

436
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:07,360
Meng Meng, you can definitely do it.

437
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,760
I've walked this path for ten years.

438
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:18,280
I've worked hard for ten years.

439
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:21,400
But I still haven't reached my goal.

440
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,960
I've already worked so hard.

441
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:32,120
I've worked so hard.

442
00:22:34,600 --> 00:22:36,720
Meng Meng, I know...

443
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,600
I saw it.

444
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:41,360
Even if you didn't pass,

445
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:44,359
you're still the greatest Meng Ting Hui in the whole world.

446
00:22:44,360 --> 00:22:46,480
You're the most unique Meng Ting Hui.

447
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:58,079
"The loyal and righteous are silent,"

448
00:22:58,080 --> 00:22:59,856
"while the wicked and sycophantic advance day by day."

449
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:00,880
"Their faults are never seen,"

450
00:23:00,881 --> 00:23:02,240
"leading to eventual ruin."

451
00:23:03,760 --> 00:23:05,360
This essay has a sharp style.

452
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:07,000
Every word hits the current issues,

453
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,000
yet it also hints at a will for reform.

454
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,480
What's even more rare is that...

455
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:13,920
it's brilliant without overstepping boundaries.

456
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:16,040
"Breaking the status quo through women."

457
00:23:16,320 --> 00:23:17,680
Such bold words...

458
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:20,560
really sound like something she would say.

459
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:21,920
Huang Bo.

460
00:23:22,120 --> 00:23:23,159
This year's Metropolitan Examination Top Scholar...

461
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:25,920
Your Majesty, she's from Qingzhou's An family.

462
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:27,080
Her name is Ru Lan.

463
00:23:33,520 --> 00:23:35,399
(An Ru Lan)

464
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,400
What about Meng Ting Hui?

465
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:38,000
What's her rank?

466
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:40,040
The Provincial Examination Top Scholar...

467
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:42,000
failed.

468
00:23:47,240 --> 00:23:48,639
The world is vast,

469
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:50,680
so it's normal to have many talents.

470
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:55,199
But the writing style and arguments...

471
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,520
are all identical.

472
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:58,320
How can that be a coincidence?

473
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:17,080
The fortune lot at Lingquan Temple isn't accurate at all.

474
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:21,440
Shazhou's Buddha Temple is better.

475
00:24:58,120 --> 00:24:59,639
Meng Meng, I've prepared...

476
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:01,640
your favorite fruit and apricot peel cakes.

477
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:07,400
It's so dark. Why didn't you light a lamp?

478
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,640
Meng Meng...

479
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:24,080
Meng Meng!

480
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:26,040
Meng Meng!

481
00:25:27,320 --> 00:25:28,320
Meng Meng.

482
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,120
What's wrong? What happened?

483
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:36,760
Meng Meng!

484
00:25:37,160 --> 00:25:39,080
A physician! Call a physician!

485
00:25:39,320 --> 00:25:40,960
Shun Zi...

486
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:42,520
Meng Meng.

487
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,760
Meng Meng...

488
00:25:47,760 --> 00:25:49,840
Meng Meng, wake up. Meng Meng!

489
00:26:23,080 --> 00:26:24,080
Meng Meng.

490
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,600
Meng Meng, you're awake.

491
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:29,560
You're so heartless.

492
00:26:29,640 --> 00:26:31,480
We agreed to go back to Shazhou together.

493
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:33,279
You didn't keep your word.

494
00:26:33,280 --> 00:26:35,040
How could you try to take your own life?

495
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:37,720
The physician said if we were a bit late,

496
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:39,719
even the gods couldn't have saved you!

497
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:41,119
You just failed the exam.

498
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:42,360
You were so foolish!

499
00:26:43,440 --> 00:26:44,440
Slow down.

500
00:26:48,800 --> 00:26:50,080
Someone tried to kill me.

501
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:52,120
Someone tried to kill you?

502
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:55,240
Who? Did you see them clearly?

503
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:57,080
It was too dark.

504
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:58,720
I couldn't see his face.

505
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:01,760
But that person was very strong.

506
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:04,040
He could have just killed me outright,

507
00:27:04,560 --> 00:27:06,280
but he wanted to make it look like suicide.

508
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:08,320
He wants me dead,

509
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,320
but is afraid of an investigation.

510
00:27:12,280 --> 00:27:13,280
Fu Zhi,

511
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:14,920
I must be in someone's way.

512
00:27:16,280 --> 00:27:18,280
There's something fishy about my exam failure.

513
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,080
That scoundrel.

514
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,720
We must catch him,

515
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:24,080
hang him from the rafters, and beat him for three days.

516
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:26,080
However...

517
00:27:26,280 --> 00:27:27,680
We just arrived in the capital,

518
00:27:27,840 --> 00:27:29,240
and we haven't offended anyone.

519
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:31,120
Who would do such a thing?

520
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:36,520
If those people find out that I'm still alive,

521
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:38,840
they won't spare me.

522
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:43,399
Let's get out of here first, then we'll figure it out.

523
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:45,280
All right. I'll go pack our things.

524
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:47,439
Forget it. Staying alive is more important.

525
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:48,480
Let's leave right now.

526
00:27:53,280 --> 00:27:54,640
- Let's go. - Careful.

527
00:27:55,320 --> 00:27:56,679
His Majesty attaches great importance...

528
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:58,096
to this Special Imperial Examination for women.

529
00:27:58,120 --> 00:27:59,976
He was especially moved by An Ru Lan's discourse on policy.

530
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,896
He personally appointed her as the Top Scholar in this exam.

531
00:28:01,920 --> 00:28:03,399
He even had it copied and sent to all provinces...

532
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,400
for everyone to study.

533
00:28:05,080 --> 00:28:07,360
Look. This is my favorite line here.

534
00:28:07,880 --> 00:28:09,159
"The loyal and righteous are silent,"

535
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:10,776
"while the wicked and sycophantic advance day by day."

536
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:12,080
"Their faults are never seen,"

537
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,960
"leading to eventual ruin."

538
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:16,080
What an essay. Such spirit.

539
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,616
No wonder she topped the Metropolitan Examination.

540
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:19,760
- Yes. - You're right. So well-written.

541
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,200
Meng Meng.

542
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:24,560
How can you be so rude?

543
00:28:27,320 --> 00:28:28,560
This is my discourse on policy.

544
00:28:29,560 --> 00:28:30,599
You failed the exam.

545
00:28:30,600 --> 00:28:32,039
How dare you say this is your discourse on policy?

546
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:33,319
Have you lost your mind from your failure?

547
00:28:33,320 --> 00:28:34,936
- You... - You attempted suicide last night.

548
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:36,320
Now, you're talking nonsense.

549
00:28:36,640 --> 00:28:38,280
You should have your head checked.

550
00:28:38,360 --> 00:28:40,759
Ms. Meng, our dynasty strictly forbids exam fraud.

551
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:42,119
Such a thing is impossible.

552
00:28:42,120 --> 00:28:43,760
If Meng Meng says it's hers, it's hers.

553
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:46,080
The suicide story is utterly ridiculous.

554
00:28:46,520 --> 00:28:47,999
If I hear such a rumor again,

555
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:49,240
I'll rip your mouths apart!

556
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:50,800
Meng Meng, let's go.

557
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:52,640
You...

558
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:58,920
Meng Meng, I knew you could pass.

559
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:01,720
How dare An Ru Lan steal your discourse on policy?

560
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:03,519
Let's report this to the officials now, expose her,

561
00:29:03,520 --> 00:29:05,720
and reclaim your title as the Top Scholar of this exam.

562
00:29:06,520 --> 00:29:07,560
It's not that simple.

563
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,720
The situation here...

564
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:11,640
is more complicated than we thought.

565
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:14,656
The Ministry of Rites oversees the Imperial Examinations.

566
00:29:14,680 --> 00:29:16,520
Without help from the officials there,

567
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:19,136
how would An Ru Lan dare to steal my discourse on policy?

568
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:20,440
If we report this now,

569
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:22,440
I'm afraid we'll be walking into a trap.

570
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:26,040
The capital is actually more cutthroat than Shazhou.

571
00:29:26,840 --> 00:29:28,480
You've already almost died once.

572
00:29:29,080 --> 00:29:30,080
I'm scared.

573
00:29:30,960 --> 00:29:32,079
I'll take you back to Shazhou.

574
00:29:32,080 --> 00:29:33,640
But I clearly passed the exam.

575
00:29:34,520 --> 00:29:36,640
I'm the Metropolitan Examination Top Scholar, Fu Zhi.

576
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:39,920
I can't just pretend that nothing happened.

577
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:42,640
I've worked hard for this for ten years.

578
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:45,040
If you want me to just give up now,

579
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,200
I can't accept it.

580
00:29:50,280 --> 00:29:51,280
Fine.

581
00:29:51,281 --> 00:29:53,120
We're not leaving. I'll stay with you.

582
00:29:53,760 --> 00:29:54,959
Even if we must go through hell and high water,

583
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:56,240
I'll go through it with you.

584
00:29:58,640 --> 00:29:59,640
But...

585
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:01,800
We don't know anyone in the capital.

586
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:03,720
Aren't Young Master He...

587
00:30:03,760 --> 00:30:04,879
and Young Master Shen...

588
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:06,160
in the capital?

589
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,720
Can we go find them?

590
00:30:10,160 --> 00:30:12,160
Things are still unclear right now.

591
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:14,760
Rashly setting out to find them may not help.

592
00:30:16,040 --> 00:30:17,720
Then... Then what should we do?

593
00:30:18,080 --> 00:30:19,280
They want to silence me,

594
00:30:20,080 --> 00:30:22,216
but they also want to avoid making this into a big deal.

595
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:23,280
In that case,

596
00:30:23,800 --> 00:30:25,800
we'll make sure this becomes the talk of the town.

597
00:30:26,320 --> 00:30:27,760
By the time we report it,

598
00:30:28,040 --> 00:30:29,400
they will have reservations.

599
00:30:31,760 --> 00:30:33,240
His Majesty has arrived!

600
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:39,799
I, Zhang Ming Shan, welcome Your Majesty.

601
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:41,120
You may all rise.

602
00:30:41,560 --> 00:30:43,680
- Thank you, Your Majesty. - Thank you, Your Majesty.

603
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:47,000
Official Zhang.

604
00:30:47,480 --> 00:30:49,200
I cast a divination this morning.

605
00:30:49,760 --> 00:30:51,040
The hexagram says...

606
00:30:51,600 --> 00:30:52,839
that among the failed exam papers,

607
00:30:52,840 --> 00:30:54,120
there is a hidden pearl.

608
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:56,799
Do you think someone was so blind...

609
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:59,376
that they mistook a luminous pearl for a fish eye and threw it away?

610
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,560
Your Majesty must be joking.

611
00:31:00,720 --> 00:31:02,760
We have always been meticulous in reviewing papers.

612
00:31:02,880 --> 00:31:03,880
How could...

613
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:07,760
I just said it casually.

614
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:09,800
Why are you so frightened?

615
00:31:10,680 --> 00:31:11,680
Huang Bo.

616
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:15,040
Doesn't his reaction...

617
00:31:15,080 --> 00:31:16,200
look exactly like...

618
00:31:17,560 --> 00:31:18,799
someone with a guilty conscience?

619
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:19,800
It does.

620
00:31:21,360 --> 00:31:22,640
If I may be so bold,

621
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:24,520
there have been rumors lately...

622
00:31:24,680 --> 00:31:26,920
that some examinees who failed are holding a grudge...

623
00:31:27,040 --> 00:31:28,400
and spreading rumors on purpose.

624
00:31:28,600 --> 00:31:31,120
I'm worried that someone is trying to deceive Your Majesty...

625
00:31:31,240 --> 00:31:33,039
and disrupt the Imperial Court's talent selection.

626
00:31:33,040 --> 00:31:35,240
In that case, why don't I make a bet with you?

627
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:38,720
If I find a pearl among these failed papers,

628
00:31:40,080 --> 00:31:41,800
I'll borrow your head...

629
00:31:42,520 --> 00:31:45,120
and kick it as a cuju ball, how about that?

630
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:47,960
Your Majesty is busy with many matters.

631
00:31:48,280 --> 00:31:49,560
We've already filtered out...

632
00:31:49,800 --> 00:31:51,440
those mediocre essays.

633
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:53,239
Why don't I present...

634
00:31:53,240 --> 00:31:55,440
the top-tier works of the scholars who passed to you?

635
00:31:55,680 --> 00:31:58,640
You... You can review them while having tea.

636
00:32:00,760 --> 00:32:01,920
What are you waiting for?

637
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:03,400
Bring the papers.

638
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,680
Yes.

639
00:32:05,200 --> 00:32:06,200
Zheng Ru.

640
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:25,440
According to this article,

641
00:32:25,560 --> 00:32:26,839
the discourse on policy of the Top Scholar in this exam is a fraud.

642
00:32:26,840 --> 00:32:27,879
Is it possible...

643
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:29,536
that the other students' essays were also plagiarized?

644
00:32:29,560 --> 00:32:30,560
Right.

645
00:32:30,720 --> 00:32:32,320
It should be just as it says here.

646
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:35,959
Make all the exam papers public! Isn't that right?

647
00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:37,599
- Yes! - Make them public!

648
00:32:37,600 --> 00:32:38,959
- Make them public! - Show us the exam papers!

649
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:42,319
- Show us the papers! - No to backroom deals!

650
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:43,320
Show us the papers!

651
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:45,520
What are you doing?

652
00:32:46,520 --> 00:32:48,520
- Stop reading it! Hand it over! - Who are they?

653
00:32:48,760 --> 00:32:51,176
Why do they act exactly like the Black Tiger Clan in Shazhou?

654
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:52,999
They must be the ones who are trying to kill me.

655
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:54,360
They failed last night.

656
00:32:54,800 --> 00:32:56,080
Now that this has blown up,

657
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:57,959
they won't spare me.

658
00:32:57,960 --> 00:33:00,160
Even in the capital, there are such lawless villains.

659
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:02,280
They actually dare to attack in broad daylight.

660
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:06,640
- Capture them! - They're after me.

661
00:33:07,080 --> 00:33:08,080
Let's split up.

662
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:09,439
Go to the Shen Residence and find Young Master Shen.

663
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:10,719
That might be our only hope.

664
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:12,496
I'm going to make a big show of going to the Metropolitan Office.

665
00:33:12,520 --> 00:33:14,736
The government office can't be biased with everyone watching.

666
00:33:14,760 --> 00:33:15,760
Go.

667
00:33:15,761 --> 00:33:18,640
(Gu Manor)

668
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:21,960
Chancellor.

669
00:33:23,120 --> 00:33:24,120
Chancellor.

670
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:25,759
Someone wrote an article...

671
00:33:25,760 --> 00:33:27,359
claiming the Metropolitan Examination's Top Scholar...

672
00:33:27,360 --> 00:33:28,600
is an imposter.

673
00:33:28,760 --> 00:33:31,039
By now, it has spread all over the streets.

674
00:33:31,040 --> 00:33:32,840
Exam fraud is the Ministry of Rites' problem.

675
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:35,400
The bigger the mess, the better.

676
00:33:36,120 --> 00:33:37,680
We shall just sit back, watch,

677
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:39,799
and enjoy this show.

678
00:33:39,800 --> 00:33:41,279
(Metropolitan Examination Top Scholar's theft of policy discourse)

679
00:33:41,280 --> 00:33:42,360
"Meng Ting Hui."

680
00:33:43,840 --> 00:33:45,160
Have you looked into her?

681
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,000
Left Chancellor.

682
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:50,839
She was the commoner...

683
00:33:50,840 --> 00:33:52,800
who helped His Majesty escape in Shazhou.

684
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:55,040
She is well-versed in street-smart tricks.

685
00:33:55,240 --> 00:33:56,599
Her actions are devious and unpredictable.

686
00:33:56,600 --> 00:33:57,760
She is hard to guard against.

687
00:33:58,040 --> 00:33:59,440
If she hadn't interfered,

688
00:34:00,080 --> 00:34:02,000
I would have brought His Majesty back long ago.

689
00:34:02,520 --> 00:34:04,839
No wonder His Majesty has been acting...

690
00:34:04,840 --> 00:34:07,360
more absurd and rebellious since his return from Shazhou.

691
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:09,439
It turns out his mind has been bewitched...

692
00:34:09,440 --> 00:34:11,760
by such a lowly, demonic woman.

693
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:13,760
A mere insect like her...

694
00:34:14,640 --> 00:34:16,760
even dares to meddle in the Imperial Court's affairs.

695
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:18,920
This woman cannot be allowed to live.

696
00:34:24,200 --> 00:34:25,320
It seems like...

697
00:34:27,200 --> 00:34:28,440
a little chaos...

698
00:34:28,520 --> 00:34:30,920
might not necessarily be a bad thing.

699
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:32,919
Meng Ting Hui scattered rubbings of the text...

700
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:34,119
all over the capital.

701
00:34:34,120 --> 00:34:35,599
Although Vice Minister Zhang...

702
00:34:35,600 --> 00:34:37,280
was in full charge of the exam,

703
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,936
it is ultimately the Ministry of Rites' responsibility.

704
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,560
If you are implicated...

705
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,320
Why are you so worried?

706
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:45,640
I have long advised His Majesty...

707
00:34:45,920 --> 00:34:47,296
that the Special Imperial Examination for women...

708
00:34:47,320 --> 00:34:48,600
is utterly ridiculous.

709
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:51,800
But His Majesty insisted on doing it his way.

710
00:34:52,240 --> 00:34:53,520
Now, look what happened.

711
00:34:54,040 --> 00:34:56,039
Meng Ting Hui has caused...

712
00:34:56,040 --> 00:34:57,920
a scandal that makes us a laughingstock.

713
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,880
The one who should be worried now...

714
00:35:00,040 --> 00:35:01,520
is His Majesty.

715
00:35:02,080 --> 00:35:03,119
I heard that His Majesty...

716
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:05,096
has already gone to the Imperial Examination Hall.

717
00:35:05,120 --> 00:35:06,720
The Emperor himself...

718
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:08,920
actually left the palace for a demonic woman?

719
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:11,520
He is truly possessed.

720
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:13,000
Utterly muddle-headed.

721
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:15,040
In that case,

722
00:35:15,920 --> 00:35:18,600
I will make sure this Special Imperial Examination for women...

723
00:35:19,040 --> 00:35:21,240
is completely terminated.

724
00:35:21,600 --> 00:35:22,760
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

725
00:35:22,880 --> 00:35:23,880
I deserve to die.

726
00:35:24,120 --> 00:35:26,600
I was careless just now and fell into the water vat.

727
00:35:27,080 --> 00:35:28,640
I tried my best to save it,

728
00:35:29,040 --> 00:35:30,040
but this exam paper...

729
00:35:31,640 --> 00:35:33,080
Are you hurt?

730
00:35:33,640 --> 00:35:35,680
Should I immediately summon the imperial physician?

731
00:35:35,720 --> 00:35:37,360
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty.

732
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:39,600
I am fine.

733
00:35:40,080 --> 00:35:41,200
Since you are fine,

734
00:35:41,720 --> 00:35:42,999
then I'll have to trouble Vice Minister Zheng...

735
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:45,000
to bring me the transcribed copy instead.

736
00:35:46,560 --> 00:35:47,600
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

737
00:35:48,040 --> 00:35:50,600
Last night, a swarm of rats entered the courtyard's side room.

738
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:52,280
Those wretched rats...

739
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:55,160
gnawed through all the transcribed copies of the exam papers.

740
00:35:56,400 --> 00:35:58,280
Those wretched rats...

741
00:35:59,240 --> 00:36:01,720
really should have drowned in the water vat.

742
00:36:04,040 --> 00:36:05,960
Your Majesty must be joking.

743
00:36:10,080 --> 00:36:11,240
You two...

744
00:36:11,560 --> 00:36:13,360
are so wholeheartedly dedicated...

745
00:36:13,840 --> 00:36:15,200
to your duties.

746
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:17,536
Staying in the Ministry of Rites...

747
00:36:17,560 --> 00:36:19,160
is truly a waste of your talents.

748
00:36:20,120 --> 00:36:21,680
Your Majesty, you flatter us.

749
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:26,000
Your Majesty, the courtyard has long been in disrepair.

750
00:36:26,800 --> 00:36:28,720
We've urged the Ministry of Revenue many times,

751
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:31,200
but the funds have yet to be released.

752
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:33,200
That is why this misfortune occurred.

753
00:36:33,640 --> 00:36:35,680
As the Vice Minister of Rites,

754
00:36:35,720 --> 00:36:37,120
I deserve to be punished.

755
00:36:37,200 --> 00:36:38,200
All right.

756
00:36:38,680 --> 00:36:40,400
We'll do as you say.

757
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:43,280
Huang Bo, what is the punishment for this according to the law?

758
00:36:43,520 --> 00:36:44,520
Your Majesty,

759
00:36:45,080 --> 00:36:46,896
for destroying the papers in the Special Imperial Examination,

760
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:49,440
the penalty is thirty strokes of the cane by law.

761
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:51,280
Oversee the execution personally.

762
00:36:51,720 --> 00:36:53,240
Flog them right here in the courtyard!

763
00:37:04,080 --> 00:37:06,080
My lady, I've bought the pastries you wanted.

764
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:08,399
All right. Hold the rouge I bought for me.

765
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,400
Yes.

766
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:16,960
After them!

767
00:37:17,520 --> 00:37:18,520
Hurry...

768
00:37:19,120 --> 00:37:20,120
Where are they?

769
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:21,760
Check over there!

770
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:23,799
To find out how the young master solves this mysterious case,

771
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:25,200
tune in for the next installment!

772
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:27,280
- Great! - Nice!

773
00:37:30,480 --> 00:37:31,840
What's going on?

774
00:37:32,480 --> 00:37:33,480
What's up?

775
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:34,960
Everyone.

776
00:37:34,961 --> 00:37:37,176
I am Meng Ting Hui, the Top Scholar of Shazhou's Examination.

777
00:37:37,200 --> 00:37:39,120
I came to the capital for the exam, but failed.

778
00:37:39,200 --> 00:37:40,559
Yet I discovered that the discourse on policy of An Ru Lan,

779
00:37:40,560 --> 00:37:42,136
the Metropolitan Examinations' Top Scholar,

780
00:37:42,160 --> 00:37:44,120
is identical to mine word-for-word.

781
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:46,039
I have decided to go to the Metropolitan Office...

782
00:37:46,040 --> 00:37:48,440
to ask the Magistrate to investigate the truth.

783
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:53,800
If you are interested,

784
00:37:54,480 --> 00:37:56,440
please follow me to witness the spectacle.

785
00:37:56,920 --> 00:37:58,439
See who the real Top Scholar of the Metropolitan Examination is.

786
00:37:58,440 --> 00:38:00,199
Between Meng Ting Hui and An Ru Lan,

787
00:38:00,200 --> 00:38:01,760
who is the fraud?

788
00:38:02,400 --> 00:38:03,800
If any scoundrels try to attack me,

789
00:38:04,120 --> 00:38:05,960
I ask you all to act with justice.

790
00:38:06,280 --> 00:38:08,136
Help me tie them up and take them to the government office.

791
00:38:08,160 --> 00:38:09,720
I will reward you handsomely.

792
00:38:16,200 --> 00:38:18,719
- Great! - All right!

793
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:19,999
Boss, there are too many people here.

794
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:21,119
It's hard for us to make a move.

795
00:38:21,120 --> 00:38:23,760
Send someone to ask Second Master how we should handle this woman.

796
00:38:25,160 --> 00:38:26,160
You are...

797
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:28,399
Miss, we met outside the Imperial Examination Hall.

798
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,959
You must be Grand Tutor Shen's daughter,

799
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:31,200
and Young Master Shen's sister.

800
00:38:32,160 --> 00:38:33,520
You're the third one this month.

801
00:38:34,040 --> 00:38:35,536
Whatever romantic debts my brother owes,

802
00:38:35,560 --> 00:38:36,959
you can go to our residence to find him.

803
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,439
Why do you keep sneaking into my carriage?

804
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:39,719
- Driver. - Ms. Shen,

805
00:38:39,720 --> 00:38:41,359
Young Master Shen and I met in Shazhou.

806
00:38:41,360 --> 00:38:43,240
I've come to him this time to see justice done.

807
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:44,960
See justice done?

808
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:48,936
Where are they? You guys, go over there!

809
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:50,200
Go! The rest of you, follow me!

810
00:38:50,440 --> 00:38:52,279
(Dried Fruits Shop)

811
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:54,880
How can you prove that Meng Ting Hui wrote this?

812
00:38:55,240 --> 00:38:57,280
And how do I know you aren't framing people?

813
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,096
According to "The Great Ning Code",

814
00:38:59,120 --> 00:39:01,336
those who cheat or commit identity theft in the imperial exams...

815
00:39:01,360 --> 00:39:02,480
shall be exiled 3,000 miles.

816
00:39:02,600 --> 00:39:03,600
Falsely accusing the Metropolitan Examination's Top Scholar...

817
00:39:03,601 --> 00:39:04,680
is also a grave crime.

818
00:39:05,720 --> 00:39:07,559
Ms. Shen, I swear on my life.

819
00:39:07,560 --> 00:39:08,840
This is the absolute truth.

820
00:39:08,880 --> 00:39:11,560
If I have uttered a single lie, you may hand me to the authorities.

821
00:39:12,680 --> 00:39:13,680
Stop!

822
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:17,960
My lady, a group of people is blocking the road.

823
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:20,800
Those people outside...

824
00:39:21,080 --> 00:39:22,120
are here for you?

825
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:25,840
Last night, someone tried to silence Meng Ting Hui.

826
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:28,096
We're powerless, so we could only blow this matter up.

827
00:39:28,120 --> 00:39:29,680
But these men started chasing after us.

828
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:31,736
Meng Meng's fate currently hangs in the balance.

829
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:33,840
Ms. Shen, please help us and save her.

830
00:39:36,120 --> 00:39:38,320
Someone saw them get into this carriage.

831
00:39:38,640 --> 00:39:40,440
Everyone in the carriage, get out now!

832
00:39:42,920 --> 00:39:43,920
Don't worry.

833
00:39:48,400 --> 00:39:50,320
Blocking the carriage of an official's family...

834
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:52,560
is punishable by 60 canes and a year's exile.

835
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:54,720
The penalty is double for those with weapons.

836
00:39:54,800 --> 00:39:55,920
Back off at once.

837
00:39:56,680 --> 00:39:58,120
So you're the family of an official.

838
00:39:58,560 --> 00:39:59,560
Our apologies.

839
00:39:59,920 --> 00:40:01,040
We meant no offense.

840
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:04,000
However, we are only looking for a wretched girl.

841
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:06,400
You...

842
00:40:19,160 --> 00:40:20,680
Who's so blind as to...

843
00:40:25,640 --> 00:40:28,240
(Di Nian, Shenwei Army Captain)

844
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:30,200
- Nian. - Captain Di.

845
00:40:30,720 --> 00:40:31,960
The Shenwei Army are on patrol.

846
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:33,880
You are gathering to cause trouble...

847
00:40:34,080 --> 00:40:35,360
and harass the citizens.

848
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:37,199
- Arrest them all! - Yes!

849
00:40:37,200 --> 00:40:38,400
Guys, retreat!

850
00:40:40,080 --> 00:40:41,080
Stop right there!

851
00:40:49,720 --> 00:40:50,720
Zhi Li.

852
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:52,480
Were you frightened?

853
00:40:52,640 --> 00:40:53,640
I'm fine.

854
00:40:54,840 --> 00:40:55,840
Zhi Li,

855
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:57,256
let me escort you back to your residence.

856
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,360
Where is His Majesty now?

857
00:41:06,640 --> 00:41:07,640
Did I just...

858
00:41:07,880 --> 00:41:08,960
count it by mistake?

859
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:12,280
How could you even count by mistake?

860
00:41:12,440 --> 00:41:13,576
Your Majesty, please hear me out.

861
00:41:13,600 --> 00:41:15,080
I felt sorry for the two officials.

862
00:41:15,240 --> 00:41:17,560
In a moment of softheartedness, I lost track of the count.

863
00:41:17,600 --> 00:41:18,720
Since you can't count,

864
00:41:20,160 --> 00:41:21,880
then start the flogging from the beginning.

865
00:41:22,240 --> 00:41:23,240
Don't.

866
00:41:23,720 --> 00:41:26,520
Fif... Fifteen.

867
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:28,320
You remember that quite clearly.

868
00:41:28,920 --> 00:41:30,496
It seems like you weren't hit hard enough.

869
00:41:30,520 --> 00:41:31,520
Huang Bo.

870
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:32,760
Continue.

871
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:39,200
This year, 100 examinees took the Metropolitan Examination.

872
00:41:39,400 --> 00:41:42,120
As Shazhou's Top Scholar, Meng Ting Hui actually failed.

873
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:43,880
I find this very suspicious.

874
00:41:44,280 --> 00:41:45,760
I wasn't certain before,

875
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:47,959
but now that the exam papers are destroyed one after another,

876
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:48,960
tell me,

877
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:50,920
is this just a coincidence?

878
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:54,320
I... I really don't know.

879
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:56,519
Then I'll find someone who does.

880
00:41:56,520 --> 00:41:58,319
Summon all the officials in charge of supervision,

881
00:41:58,320 --> 00:42:00,959
transcription, anonymization, and review here.

882
00:42:00,960 --> 00:42:02,960
It will take some time to investigate all of them.

883
00:42:03,320 --> 00:42:04,320
Why don't we...

884
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:07,680
give him 30 more flogs first?

885
00:42:11,080 --> 00:42:12,160
I confess.

886
00:42:13,080 --> 00:42:14,600
I'm willing to confess.

887
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:16,879
Fraud in the imperial examination...

888
00:42:16,880 --> 00:42:18,199
is a grave injustice!

889
00:42:18,200 --> 00:42:19,720
Everyone, come and see!

890
00:42:20,360 --> 00:42:21,360
How could such a thing happen?

891
00:42:21,361 --> 00:42:22,576
Fraud in Special Imperial Examination.

892
00:42:22,600 --> 00:42:24,280
There's drama to see. Let's go...

893
00:42:25,040 --> 00:42:26,320
I am the scholar, Meng Ting Hui,

894
00:42:26,880 --> 00:42:27,920
Shazhou's Top Scholar.

895
00:42:28,920 --> 00:42:31,416
An Ru Lan stole my Metropolitan Examination's discourse on policy.

896
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:32,440
I am going to the Metropolitan Office now...

897
00:42:32,441 --> 00:42:33,599
to ask the officials for justice,

898
00:42:33,600 --> 00:42:35,760
reveal the truth of the exam fraud,

899
00:42:36,080 --> 00:42:38,176
and restore fairness to the Special Imperial Examination!

900
00:42:38,200 --> 00:42:39,200
It's Meng Ting Hui.

901
00:42:39,720 --> 00:42:41,559
Come on, follow her. Let's go to the Metropolitan Office.

902
00:42:41,560 --> 00:42:43,279
Let's all go to the Metropolitan Office...

903
00:42:43,280 --> 00:42:47,119
to demand justice!

904
00:42:47,120 --> 00:42:49,439
(Perspicacious and impartial in judgment)

905
00:42:49,440 --> 00:42:50,640
I, the scholar, Meng Ting Hui,

906
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,856
am accusing the Metropolitan Examination's Top Scholar,

907
00:42:52,880 --> 00:42:54,376
An Ru Lan, of stealing my discourse on policy.

908
00:42:54,400 --> 00:42:55,960
Please seek justice for me, Magistrate.

909
00:42:56,320 --> 00:42:57,320
Confucius said,

910
00:42:57,720 --> 00:42:59,240
"Think carefully before acting."

911
00:42:59,680 --> 00:43:01,760
"Twice is enough."

912
00:43:02,360 --> 00:43:04,919
You spread this article across the capital,

913
00:43:04,920 --> 00:43:06,400
causing a massive uproar.

914
00:43:06,600 --> 00:43:07,720
Do you have any evidence?

915
00:43:07,840 --> 00:43:09,240
You can summon An Ru Lan...

916
00:43:09,640 --> 00:43:10,760
to testify in court.

917
00:43:11,160 --> 00:43:12,160
Magistrate,

918
00:43:12,720 --> 00:43:14,119
the commoners outside...

919
00:43:14,120 --> 00:43:15,560
were all brought here by her.

920
00:43:17,960 --> 00:43:19,960
Summon the Metropolitan Examination's Top Scholar.
